Flow: Responsive Folio3 Parking web app. Employees sign in with Google and are routed by their verified role to the employee or administrator workspace. Employees see their assignment, register a vehicle if needed, release or schedule a dedicated space, and eligible employees claim released spaces. Parking Administrators manage employee assignments, parking settings and roles, inspect weekly utilization and entry checks, and review retained audit history. Authentication validation, email delivery, weekly job execution, and trusted LPR/hardware commands are backend integrations, not separate user pages. All pages use the light visual treatment, shared role-specific header, consistent sample records, and responsive phone, tablet, and desktop layouts.

